  ESMA or SWIFT example or schema.

  Element paths follow the real ESMA EMIR REFIT usage guideline
  auth.108.001.01_ESMAUG_DATMDA_1.1.0 (DerivativesTradeMarginDataReportV01):
  Document > DerivsTradMrgnDataRpt > {RptHdr/NbRcrds,
  TradData/Rpt/(MrgnUpd|Crrctn)...}. Only the subset OpenDQI extracts is
  populated. Schema-shaped, not a fully XSD-valid instance. See
  docs/auth-messages/emir-auth108.md.

  action_type is derived from the TradeReport31Choice wrapper
  (MrgnUpd -> "MRGN", Crrctn -> "CORR"); neither is in the
  EMIR.MAR.MARGIN_TYPE_ENUM allowed set {MARU,MARV,MARC,MARN}, so that
  check fires on every record (documented limitation). Each <Rpt>
  additionally exercises one EMIR.MAR.* check.
-->
